{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_5331cb469b82","title":"丁爸 情报分析师的工具箱","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158068&idx=1&sn=e8a0450ed82aa22f2a3e18d25fb69f1f&chksm=f012ba3a20510d32f80d47cf0500c9464d88daf1571b2f1fc78436207b38f4a22cf5ea72e22a&scene=126&sessionid=1795180785#rd","description":"每天为大家精选各类情报分析相关的资源、工具、技巧和资讯，努力成为情报分析师必备的工具箱。外挂机器人“小丁丁”还能陪您聊天，给您查航班、查列车、查天气、查酒店、查美食、查股票、回答您的提问等等。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"丁爸 情报分析师的工具箱","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FUGrobmT8GcLqtMLDWHBic3PZ9IicdJxicSLTTBibQicVAuj4AGD0LclNYnTwuHbwWvGlrsVxZCvB2GwE%2F0","updated":"2026-11-18T03:25:21.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158068:1","title":"【技巧】人工智能赋能开源情报（OSINT）实操指南","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158068&idx=1&sn=e8a0450ed82aa22f2a3e18d25fb69f1f&chksm=f012ba3a20510d32f80d47cf0500c9464d88daf1571b2f1fc78436207b38f4a22cf5ea72e22a&scene=126&sessionid=1795180785#rd","description":"AI 在 OSINT 中的正确定位是放大器，不是替代品。放大器意味着：输入垃圾，输出更多垃圾；输入没有验证的线索，输出看起来更可信的谣言。所以本指南把“验证”放在与“采集”同等重要的位置。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NEboIRFsiczZGic1OKbGhH5sdhdpBKSnKcv8RDkuVTlC85ABZEFT8COYN6dAQgOh2eeMOFb0aQcfaczIeVibiabOtMGfb0ntpkrll4%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T03:25:21.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158056:1","title":"【开源报告】俄乌战争中的俄罗斯军事情报： 失误、适应与代价（2022–2026）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158056&idx=1&sn=3c18cd4527bd957984b1e20002518c71&chksm=f04ce55b62d1174a786472f8902b516f12bcb17667f2da27bbb15806d78f8e6f173c6e59f188&scene=126&sessionid=1795180785#rd","description":"俄罗斯军事情报在战术—技术维度完成了战争史上罕见的快速学习，在战略—制度维度（评估独立性、问责、反间谍专业度）改进有限。这一不对称意味着：俄情报对\"已知战场\"的支撑持续增强，对\"未知变量\"（对手突然性、领导层偏见、己方制度缺陷）依然脆弱。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGzMQvbDD13YhLzSmuj3qib4XaykyMWSxWUOyib2dyNMfs4YtJIFSppoeriaILHKgZaeM75yEdwYQvtzbb0zNwvJZKjK987NjQRv0%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-16T03:49:42.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158051:1","title":"【资料】最新CIA的情报研究杂志内容介绍","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158051&idx=1&sn=dadacb4c60fc7a13282aee499f28c8e7&chksm=f0f97e94812762ccb31ac37acc0aa4db071c54492afbc1c394d516cf066fad6311e8ea3a9602&scene=126&sessionid=1795180785#rd","description":"今天给大家介绍美国中情局情报研究中心（Center for the Study of Intelligence）主办的专业期刊《Studies in Intelligence》第 70 卷第 3 期（节选版，2026 年 9 月）。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NFDWWdkL6icddxL5cOxNicxUqtNZNfBIp0DAqoZBTy6BUAdvNdjBu7XfkdKC6N0HwCmI42gBJLtF72cia4UB37RAnpCIFKdhdqtAs%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-15T02:36:07.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158046:1","title":"【开源技巧】AIS 定位异常船舶挖掘实用指南","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158046&idx=1&sn=826fdddb9b889819d51060b25068b08f&chksm=f071dd5f24267948300138c98c03aa39541aed149a87fe54d7435cff890057b4b993a6b0a9b9&scene=126&sessionid=1795180785#rd","description":"AIS 定位异常船舶挖掘实用指南适用对象：海事态势感知分析员、合规与制裁筛查团队、海警/海关情报岗、航运风险尽调人员，以及搭建\"暗船\"检测流水线的数据工程师。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NEMA2Gt7T52gBAicTrYdXRwiaIWCRrbkkRptu5f29lgoOfgpXWsDIhjCdTPlRt0DxayBdS31D3BmAODsczg7YKyoRr27PDed2Gpg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-13T08:27:48.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158036:1","title":"【开源报告】美军陆军情报条令的历史变迁与未来发展趋势预测（1994—2035）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158036&idx=1&sn=3651e217216ec4072ea3fc48096377b8&chksm=f03f95dbb4893d98289562e6e5825115b67bb2be85aea3dc5c71e32241bb7550cf131d19b347&scene=126&sessionid=1795180785#rd","description":"美军把情报从一种支援性的作战系统，改写成了一种竞争性的信息能力。1994 年版问的是「情报够不够快」，2008 年版问的是「情报算不算一种作战职能」，2018—2019 年版问的是「在被打击的条件下还能不能拿到情报」，2026 年版问的是「能不能凭情报取得优势」。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NEadw3P5LgAs3AJuO6sMUIwTnUElHGlOyfs0sUm1SZdMI6ZnsPHCu83mHjPCW6lWByibzRp5nHMP50qgLZqDbq77wywXsDsNKIc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-11T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158022:1","title":"【开源报告】美国陆军未来关键发展趋势深度研究","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158022&idx=1&sn=3ca49a8fe907a4b2f22525a4fd7d273a&chksm=f0734a6a888a34eb0fe32091c14f0db535fb24fb636262346ebfad8c61d7ed8d474b6688df04&scene=126&sessionid=1795180785#rd","description":"本地文献的时间跨度约为 2022 年至 2026 年 10 月，恰好覆盖美国陆军从「2030 年陆军」（Army 2030）现代化构想，转向 2025 年政治驱动的「全面转型」、再到 2026 年制度化落地与国会审议的完整窗口。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NENWy9Rky6oM3mmWib8VTibIjljrWMpIAZmWRPaEVvKuSguBXr1kibiafOibaWNBAEET8ZNOguXicWuwf6mxAxhcHktvR9WZGuib1ss7E%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-09T04:59:22.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158011:1","title":"【开源报告】气象与气候对战争进程的影响-俄乌战争等为例","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158011&idx=1&sn=e6ea1d7ea2a62b7c703f3e4a31536c05&chksm=f0424ec7384e4accceaf55197b3439da6c08185b90198f1a497d6b1a97d77d6312fe9269e617&scene=126&sessionid=1795180785#rd","description":"泥泞道路严重限制了坦克、火炮等重型机械化部队的越野机动能力，迫使交战双方往往只能沿着铺设好的硬质公路推进，从而减缓了大规模装甲攻势的步伐。严冬时节土壤冻结变硬，能够承受重型车辆的通行，在一定程度上为机械化部队提供快速机动的条件。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGsNB1dxhSbShcGAic2wrcTX5pA9FzWcts0SiaLbbSGmYo6vulEPwpo7PbrlXeAWyb99iciae8KKmGzjDv3zy4KnzibaZ5RGXiajsYsc%2F640%3Fw